  "pageshortdescription": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "shortDescTop": "<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "lee.fuller1@stryker.com",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Apr 06 2018 11:37:48 GMT-0400",
    "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/pageshortdescription",
    "textIsRich": [
      "true",
      "true",
      "true"
    ],
    "bulletList": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The kit incudes access and instrumentation products:<br>\r\n-&nbsp;Access products: scopes, cannnulas and bridge system<br>\r\n-&nbsp;Instrumentation products: punches, graspers and suture passers</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "2": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Hip Access Set was designed to help reduce the time and effort necessary to access and treat the hip joint. Portal exchange is smooth and seamless when you employ the fully cannulated cutter cannula-and-bridge system.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Hip Instruments are a comprehensive kit of precision tools that assist in tissue resection, grasping, microfracture and suture-management.</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "4": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>The angled designs of our tools are designed to optimize joint access&nbsp;and allow curvature around the femoral head for pinpoint control.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      },
      "5": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "bullet": "<p>Choice and variety of tools give you the full range of options. All hand instruments have 190 mm working length that come in straight, up, left and right angles.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n",
        "textIsRich": "true"
      }
    }
  },
